      "name": "Bridge OLM Directional Blur (Approximate)",
      "category": "Craft Bridge",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "author": "Craft Preset Bridge contributors",
      "description": "Original anisotropic alpha-max ray blur, component-based size/tails and directional noise. Not OLM kernel/calibration. Requires experimental API2 host.",
